          "ruleId": "workflow-permission-scope",
          "level": "note",
          "message": {
            "text": "(c)/(d) permission audit: the only permission change anywhere in the diff is job-scoped to pr-review-sign (contents:write -> contents:read + checks:write) and job-scoped to present (+checks:read). pr-review-quorum.yml's WORKFLOW-level permissions block is unchanged (contents: read). No job in either workflow file gains write access beyond checks:write on pr-review-sign, and that job is fork-gated (if: ...head.repo.full_name == github.repository)."
          },
